["zh-Hant"],[["【排隊與拼盤自由的拉麵店】\n店家採訂金排隊制度，先現場排隊付訂金後可以去附近閒晃，再回來即可。我非常喜歡。\n\n這次點的是 TKM生蛋拌麵+叉燒拼盤，麵體很有勁道。喜歡偏硬口感的人應該會很喜歡。建議點原味接著分三種層次吃，原味 \u003e 加檸檬 \u003e 加辣。三種享受一次滿足\n\n叉燒拼盤個人評價 炙燒雞腿 \u003e 豬叉燒 \u003e 雞叉燒，且有大、中、小的客製化，選擇彈性高，加分\n\n本來是衝著 濃雞白湯 來的 詢問後得知 近兩個月都不會有，工作人員不多，會需要花時間等候餐點，但都很親切。( 2026.7.4 )",null,[0,53]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/11231923109542534561/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPYmxOV1pGSlVhMFpQVTBSQ1UxSkhVbGxTYlU1WVVsaHJlVmxzUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2414,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOblNWZFJUa0ZPU0RCU1JHUllSbU5YUlhreVlsRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0xe675bff14055b12!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkNnSVdRTkFOSDBSRGRYRmNXRXkyYlE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOblNWZFJUa0ZPU0RCU1JHUllSbU5YUlhreVlsRRAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tOblNWZFJUa0ZPU0RCU1JHUllSbU5YUlhreVlsRRI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjl